FAQ = [('What is the ground clearance of a 2026 Ford F-150?', 'Ford lists 8.2 to 8.5 inches for 4x2 trucks and 9.8 inches for most 4x4 trucks. The SuperCrew 4x4 with the 6.5-ft box is listed at 8.8 inches.'), ('How much ground clearance does the F-150 Tremor have?', "10.7 inches, by Ford's 2026 specification sheet."), ('How much ground clearance does the F-150 Raptor have?', 'Ford prints two figures in the Raptor column, 11.9 and 13.1 inches, under a heading that reads 35-inch/37-inch tire.'), ('Do bigger tires change ground clearance?', "Yes. Ford's figures are for the truck as built. Different tires, a lift or leveling kit, or a loaded bed change the real clearance.")]

